        <!--Section 1-->
        <div class="govuk-heading-m">Overview</div>

        <p class="govuk-body">Use this page to find the Technical Specifications and Assessment Procedures for the Heat Network Technical Assurance Scheme (HNTAS). These documents set out the requirements for each part of a heat network and explain how compliance is assessed during feasibility, design, construction and operation phases. </p>
        <p class="govuk-body">
            They are intended for organisations responsible for designing, building, commissioning or operating heat networks. The documents may be updated as the scheme develops.
        </p>


